        "reading_text": "Riverside Reading Group - Standing Notes\nUpdated 14 March 2027.\nMonthly meetings\nThese notes record the standing arrangements of the reading group. The group meets on the\nsecond Sunday of each month, keeps a shared reading list, and charges no membership fee.\nSee the attendance list on page 2.\nThe shared list is maintained by the secretary and read aloud at the start of each meeting. New titles\nare added by ballot, one ballot per meeting, with the proposer speaking for two minutes.\nPage 1 of 2",
